
                       geant4-11-02-ref-09
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o New process G4CoherentPairProduction for the simulation of coherent
   pair production by high energy gamma in an oriented crystal.
 o New class G4URRNeutrons to enable the special treatment of the Unresolved
   Resonance Region (URR) via Particle Tables (PT) for low-energy neutrons.
 o In de-excitation hadronic model, improved algorithm for handling of broken
   levels in G4LevelReader.
 o Added sub-event parallel mode as an option in G4RunManagerFactory and
   adding a UI command for allowing trajectory merging.
 o Cleanly delete G4Event objects at the end of each run as long as the
   events are not requested to be kept for redrawing during the following
   'Idle' state. The kept events are deleted at the beginning of next run
   or at program termination.
 o New dataset: G4URRPT-1.1.

